description:
mojibake-repair: Mojibake Repair API: undoes broken encoding (UTF-8 read as Windows-1252, Latin-1 or Windows-1251, once or twice) byte by byte. Deterministic code, no language model: half-damaged text gets a CANNOT REPAIR verdict, not a guess. $0.004 USDC per call (1 cent is this catalog's minimum).
Method: POST
Input: {"input": "string, required - up to 60000 chars", "origin": "string, optional", "partial": "boolean, optional"}
